SUBJ/TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT//
WTPN22 PGTW 010130
REF/A/JOINT TYPHOON WRNCEN PEARL HARBOR HI/310730Z AUG 26//
AMPN/REF IS TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT (WTPN21 PGTW 310730)//
RMKS/
1. FORMATION OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE IS POSSIBLE WITHIN
120 NM EITHER SIDE OF A LINE FROM 19.4N 112.6E TO 23.1N 118.5E
WITHIN THE NEXT 12 TO 24 HOURS. AVAILABLE DATA DOES NOT JUSTIFY
ISSUANCE OF NUMBERED TROPICAL CYCLONE WARNINGS AT THIS TIME.
WINDS IN THE AREA ARE ESTIMATED TO BE 23 TO 28 KNOTS. METSAT
IMAGERY AT 010030Z INDICATES THAT A CIRCULATION CENTER IS LOCATED
NEAR 19.5N 112.9E. THE SYSTEM IS MOVING EAST-NORTHEASTWARD AT 09
KNOTS.
2. REMARKS:
MAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 23 TO 28 KNOTS.
MINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 1001 MB. THE
POTENTIAL FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE
WITHIN THE NEXT 24 HOURS IS HIGH.
3. THIS ALERT WILL BE REISSUED, UPGRADED TO WARNING OR CANCELLED BY 020130Z.
4. SEE REF A FOR DETAILS ON A TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT
LOCATED NEAR 21.6N 132.7E
